# LAB-4171
Demo to show how Vault Radar scans the repos in GitHub Enterprise

# Demo repos for Vault Radar

```
telco-cdr-pipeline/            CDR mediation/rating pipeline (telco)
corebank-payments-pipeline/    ISO 20022 payments + CDC pipeline (banking)
demo/DEMO-GUIDE.md             Commands, findings inventory and narrative
```

Both repos already have git history, including a commit where a secret was
introduced and another where it was "deleted" — without rotating it. That's
the case `vault-radar scan repo` finds and `scan folder` doesn't.

The secrets are fictitious. Do not publish these repos on public forums.
